# Cursor project rules

- **Always on:** `.cursor/rules/01-ai-instructions.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/02-architecture.mdc` (`alwaysApply: true`).
- **When editing `lib/**/*.dart`:** `.cursor/rules/03-product-docs-pointer.mdc` reminds you to attach `docs/prd.md` / `docs/plan.md` when needed.

Product requirements and roadmap stay in **`docs/prd.md`** and **`docs/plan.md`** (not duplicated into every chat). Use `@docs/prd.md` / `@docs/plan.md` for full text in a thread.

Legacy links to `docs/ai-instructions.md` and `docs/architecture.md` redirect to the `.mdc` rules above.
